  w_p1:'In this course AI is a program that learned from a huge number of examples and can do two things: notice patterns and build an answer for your task from them. Text, a picture, a plan, code, sound.',
  w_p2:'The answer does not come ready-made from a drawer. The model has no catalog of correct answers: every time it builds the answer again, from the patterns it noticed and from what you wrote.',
  half1:'Artificial', half1d:'Made by people. Not alive and did not grow by itself.', half2:'intelligence', half2d:'The ability to work with meaning: language, images, structure. Not consciousness and not feelings.', flip:'tap a half',
