  rm_all:'All found. AI does not hide in everything "smart", only where something is guessed from examples: words, voice, faces, tastes, routes.',
  i_p1:'If you take one thought from this page, let it be this one. Whatever you give a model, it solves one task: what most likely comes next. Give it the start of a sentence and it continues the words. Describe a picture and it continues the image. Ask for a plan and it continues the steps.',
  i_p2:'The most honest comparison: the word suggestions on a phone keyboard. Except the model continues not one word but a whole answer.',
