  ac_mix:'Partly likely, partly bold. That is roughly how a model writes: mostly likely words, sometimes a risk.', ac_real:'A model does the same thing, only with whole answers and a huge vocabulary.',
  i_c1t:'Different answers', i_c1:'There are usually several fitting continuations, so the model answers the same question differently.',
  i_c2t:'Confident tone', i_c2:'Smooth text is the most likely text. That is why even a mistake sounds confident.',
  i_c3t:'An answer is a draft', i_c3:'Likely and correct are not always the same. Check what matters.',
